{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52851","headline":"泰阶六符赋附歌 · 娄玄颖","name":"泰阶六符赋附歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君臣穆兮纯化清，玉衡正兮泰阶平。\n嘉历数兮无极，配乾坤兮永贞。\n（见《文苑英华》卷九）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"娄玄颖","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52851.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52851","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}